36	   These are the PRODUCT tokens — the portal and the builder. They are additive
37	   and share the same brand hues on purpose, because a customer crosses
38	   marketing → portal → builder in one session and the seam should be
39	   invisible. What differs is density: marketing is a poster, the product is an
